  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/J4t1Htsb/title-remodeledfence.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"318\"></p>\n<p>修改了所有栅栏和栅栏门，使其更具各自树种的独特风格。🌳</p>\n<p>同时更新了物品栏图标以匹配新的模型。如果您好奇截图中的背景，我使用的是 Complementary Reimagined 光影包。<br>本资源包更改了以下栅栏和栅栏门的模型：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><u>苍白橡木</u></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><u>竹</u></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><u>樱桃木</u></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">红树林</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">金合欢</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">白桦</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">绯红</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">深色橡木</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">丛林</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">橡木</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">云杉</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">诡异</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">下界砖（栅栏）</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>预览：</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/ZnCZRcH1/2025-05-22-00-57-51.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/Z5rmC0PK/2025-05-22-01-00-08.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/Bv40DsN5/2025-05-22-01-03-00.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>如果您有任何反馈或问题，最好的联系方式是加入 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/Gf7uPVPHZh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Remodeled Discord 服务器</a>。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/Gf7uPVPHZh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/JhtpyZrS/discord.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"265\" height=\"58\"></a></p>",
